1. Introduction

1.1 Purpose

The purpose of this Software Requirements Specification (SRS) document is to describe the requirements, architecture, features, and design of the EduBot AI system.
It serves as a reference for developers, testers, project reviewers, and future maintainers.
EduBot AI is an AI-powered educational assistant that enables users to upload educational PDF documents, ask questions, generate summaries, 
and receive context-aware answers using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), Google Gemini AI, and Optical Character Recognition (OCR).

1.2 Scope

EduBot AI is designed to help students interact with educational documents in a conversational way.
The application retrieves information directly from uploaded documents before generating answers, improving accuracy and reducing incorrect AI responses.

The system supports:
.Multiple PDF uploads
.OCR for scanned PDFs
.AI-powered question answering
.Document summarization
.Multi-language responses
.Chat history management
.Source references

1.3 Objectives

The main objectives of EduBot AI are:
.Simplify learning using AI.
.Improve document search efficiency.
.Provide accurate answers from uploaded PDFs.
.Support multiple educational documents.
.Generate summaries automatically.
.Improve student productivity.

2. Project Overview

Problem Statement

Students often spend significant time searching through lengthy PDF documents to find relevant information. 
Traditional PDF readers do not provide intelligent search or question-answering capabilities.

Proposed Solution

EduBot AI provides an AI-powered interface where users can upload educational PDFs and ask questions in natural language.
The system retrieves relevant information using semantic search and generates accurate answers using Google Gemini.

3. System Features

3.1 Multi PDF Upload
.Upload multiple educational PDF documents simultaneously.
.Automatically process uploaded files.
3.2 OCR Support
.Extract text from scanned PDF documents.
.Support image-based educational notes.
3.3 RAG Search
.Retrieve the most relevant document chunks.
.Improve answer accuracy.
3.4 AI Question Answering
.Answer only educational questions.
.Use Google Gemini AI with retrieved document context.
3.5 Chat History
.Maintain multiple conversations.
.Create new chat sessions.
.Load previous chats.
.Delete chat history.
3.6 PDF Summary
.Generate concise summaries of uploaded documents.
3.7 Multi-language Support
.Auto language detection.
.English responses.
.Hindi responses.
3.8 Source References
.Display document name and page number used for generating answers.

4. Technology Stack
| Layer           | Technology              |
| --------------- | ----------------------- |
| Frontend        | Streamlit               |
| Backend         | Python                  |
| AI Model        | Google Gemini 2.5 Flash |
| Vector Database | FAISS                   |
| Embeddings      | Sentence Transformers   |
| OCR             | Gemini OCR              |
| PDF Processing  | PyPDF                   |
| Environment     | Python 3.11+            |

5. System Architecture

                  User
                    │
                    ▼
          Streamlit Web Interface
                    │
         Upload PDF / Ask Question
                    │
                    ▼
          Document Processing Module
                    │
       OCR → Chunking → Embeddings
                    │
                    ▼
               FAISS Index
                    │
                    ▼
             RAG Retrieval Engine
                    │
                    ▼
          Google Gemini AI Model
                    │
                    ▼
         AI Generated Response
                    │
                    ▼
      Chat History + Source Reference

6. Functional Requirements

| ID    | Requirement                          |
| ----- | ------------------------------------ |
| FR-01 | Upload one or multiple PDF documents |
| FR-02 | Extract text from PDFs               |
| FR-03 | Perform OCR on scanned documents     |
| FR-04 | Generate semantic embeddings         |
| FR-05 | Store embeddings in FAISS            |
| FR-06 | Retrieve relevant document chunks    |
| FR-07 | Generate AI answers                  |
| FR-08 | Detect follow-up questions           |
| FR-09 | Maintain chat history                |
| FR-10 | Generate PDF summaries               |
| FR-11 | Support English and Hindi responses  |
| FR-12 | Display document source references   |

7. Non-Functional Requirements

Performance
.Fast document retrieval.
.Quick AI response generation.
Reliability
.Stable conversation management.
.Accurate semantic search.
Usability
.Simple and user-friendly interface.
.Easy document upload.
Security
.API key stored securely using environment variables.
.Uploaded documents remain within the current session.
Scalability
.Supports multiple PDF uploads.
.Future support for cloud deployment.

