.Flashcards
.Mind Map Generator
.Voice Input
.Text-to-Speech
.User Authentication
.Cloud Storage
.Mobile Application
.Export Chat to PDF
.Bookmark Important Answers

9. Conclusion

EduBot AI is an intelligent educational assistant that combines Artificial Intelligence, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), OCR, and 
semantic search to provide accurate, document-based answers. The system simplifies learning by enabling users to interact naturally with educational PDF documents, 
generate summaries, manage conversations, and receive reliable responses supported by source references. Its modular architecture and scalable design make it suitable for academic use and future enhancements.